//
// Pitfall #12 mitigation (CONTEXT D-23): synthesize a Sentry-like event
// carrying credential-shaped headers + body keys, run it through the
// generated `redactSensitive` Sentry beforeSend hook, and assert every
// secret is replaced with the literal "[Redacted by mcpgen]".
//
// This file is rendered into every generated tenant Worker as a static
// `tests/smoke.ts` so the F1 (Phase 5) static gate can run it via
